  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve or 1 source of fresh blood</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> 30 spaces</p><p>You manipulate an enemy's blood to worsen their wounds.</p><p>Choose an adjacent creature and make a <strong>4:1 Soul (Metaphysics</strong>) check.</p><p>The target suffers <strong>1</strong> <strong>Damage</strong> per success. This <strong>Damage</strong> ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>If the creature has <strong>Wounds</strong>, and the <strong>Damage</strong> is greater than the target's <strong>Body</strong>, it takes <strong>1 Wound</strong>.</p>",
